sangati abhisambodhana

  "sambodhana-amsha"
  -- emphatic address — intimate, close, forceful calling.
  -- "hey!", "yo", "listen"
  -- the speaker addresses with intensity or familiarity.
  -- in Sanskrit: the shortened vocative — closest register.

